cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this test bench, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "pqc-oidc-bench: a test bench for the deployability of post-quantum signatures in OAuth 2.0 / OIDC"
abstract: >-
  A bench measuring failure modes on size overflow and the cost of key
  distribution through JWKS, for OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect tokens calibrated
  on the size of post-quantum and hybrid signatures.
authors:
  - family-names: Senghor
    given-names: Antoine
repository-code: "https://github.com/asenghor/pqc-oidc-bench"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-16"
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - OAuth 2.0
  - OpenID Connect
  - JOSE
  - ML-DSA
